OL,3,GNEWSAThousands take part in
OL,4,Apro-Palestinian march through Edinburgh
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people have attended a
OL,7,Fpro-Palestinian march through the
OL,8,Fcentre of Edinburgh, marking three
OL,9,Fyears since the start of the war in
OL,10,FGaza.
OL,12,FThe event saw crowds of demonstrators
OL,13,Fgather at the foot of the Mound earlier
OL,14,Fbefore they set off towards the
OL,15,FScottish Parliament.
OL,17,FThere were numerous Palestinian flags
OL,18,Fon show along with a number of banners
OL,19,Fand placards, and many attendees wore
OL,20,Fkeffiyeh scarves - a symbol of
OL,21,FPalestinian identity.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
