OL,3,GNEWSAThousands take part in
OL,4,Apro-Palestinian march through Edinburgh
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey were accompanied by a group of
OL,7,Fdrummers, and many chanted slogans
OL,8,Fincluding "free free Palestine" and
OL,9,F"viva viva Palestina".
